insert into kb.document_versions (document_id,version,content_sha256,mime_type,byte_count,extracted_text,effective_from) values ((select id from kb.documents where document_id='LP-WEB-LIVE-CLUB-DOC'),'2026-08-05-capture','7d14291286a99f163d686d59e29f6aa19ae9423c7d98fd8394e9ca24be18c0ec','text/markdown',3590,'Archive source LP-WEB-LIVE-CLUB. Club - Where Conversations Become Collaborations.

Captured public page: https://www.lapipa.io/club

Capture timestamp: 2026-08-05T01:11:58.533Z

Page description: The beating heart of LA PIPA. Our bar is where locals and visitors share stories, spark ideas, and turn casual conversations into unexpected collaborations over Asturian cider.

THECLUBCONVERSATIONS × COLLABORATIONSYour third place between home and office#NOMADTALKSTHE NORTHOF THE SOUTHFernando and Belén sit at La Pipa — a 300-year-old cider mill reborn as a gathering place — talking about surfing, about life, and about what it means to live here, in Asturias, the North of the South.Every day, more people who seek the natural, the authentic, and the quiet rhythm of the North choose to make it their home.To all of them, we say: welcome home.THE HEART OF LA PIPAThis is our bar, our meeting spot, our LIVING ROOM and laboratory all rolled into one.WHERE ITHAPPENSWhether you''re dropping in for a morning coffee, catching up with friends in the evening, or pausing for an informal business chat, the Club is where it all happens.Here, we believe in the power of conversations to spark new ideas and join the dots between people, projects, and possibilities.☕SERENDIPITY BY DESIGNYou never quite know who you''ll meet or what new project might be born over a drink or a coffee.That''s the magic of the Club—ideas collide, connections form, and possibilities multiply.💡MORETHAN A BARAt the Club, the boundaries blur between work and play, between a casual chat and a breakthrough moment.You might overhear a debate on the future of AI at one table, a brainstorm for a new startup at another, or simply a group of friends sharing stories over vermouth.DREAMERS & DOERSCreatives and founders, makers and thinkers—open to all who want to connect and contributeTALKS & EVENTSPop-up events, micro-workshops, and impromptu meetups that spark new possibilitiesIDEAS WELCOMEBring your curiosity, your laptop, or just yourself—every visit is an opportunityTHE ORIGINSJAVI KNEW WELLBACK IN 2019Hear from Javi about what LA PIPA meant in the beginning—a vision that continues to shape who we are today.★"A space for dreamers and doers, where casual chats become breakthrough moments."CONVERSATIONS THAT MATTERMONDOSONOROMAGAZINEA forward-looking perspective on how technology, data, audiences, and the future of Web3 are reshaping the music industry — examining the impact of the cookie''s disappearance and the new opportunities emerging for artists and creators.🏠YOUR THIRD PLACEBETWEEN HOME & OFFICENot quite home, not quite office—just La Pipa. Bring your ideas, your curiosity, your laptop, or just yourself.Stay for five minutes or five hours. Every conversation is a chance to connect dots, make friends, and build something new together.Sometimes there''s a guest speaker. Sometimes there''s music. Often, there''s a sense of serendipity.The Club is an open space for gathering, sharing, and growing—where work and play blur into something more meaningful.OPEN DAILYCASUAL × CREATIVEWhere morning coffee meets evening vermouth and everything in between.GATHER, SHARE,GROWLa Pipa Club is where connections happen naturally. Pull up a chair, join a conversation, or start your own.From casual catch-ups to deep discussions about the future—this is where the community comes alive.★DROPINThe Club is open—join us for a conversation that could change everything.VISIT USCoffee / Conversation / CollaborationOPEN DAILY•ALL WELCOME•IDEAS ENCOURAGEDYOUR THIRD PLACE','2026-08-05T00:00:00Z') on conflict (document_id,version) do update set content_sha256=excluded.content_sha256,byte_count=excluded.byte_count,extracted_text=excluded.extracted_text;
