Page description: AI Impact: Industry think-tanks exploring the future of artificial intelligence and innovation.

Futures 20212021 ISSUEFUTURES2021AI IMPACT / INDUSTRY THINK-TANKSEXCLUSIVESHOWCASEPERSPECTIVESWhere AI Meets InnovationA curated collection of conversations with industry leaders, exploring the transformative impact of artificial intelligence across sectors and societies.In 2021, LA PIPA launched Futures to create space for meaningful dialogue about emerging technologies. We brought together visionaries, skeptics, and practitioners to explore how AI reshapes business, culture, and human experience.VIDEO SERIESIntimate discussions with thought leaders shaping the future of AI and technology innovation.• Ethics in AI development• Industry transformation stories• Future-forward thinking• Human-AI collaboration2021: The AI Inflection PointContextPre-GPT era, organizations wrestled with machine learning applications, struggling to move from experimentation to implementation.QuestionsHow do we build ethical AI? What skills matter in an AI-augmented world? Who decides how these systems shape society?ImpactThese conversations formed the foundation for LA PIPA''s approach to AI-native thinking and human-centered design.WATCH THE SERIESExplore the full collection of Futures 2021 conversationsContinue ExploringFUTURES 2022 →FUTURES 2023 →JOIN THECONVERSATIONBe part of shaping the future. Connect with LA PIPA.GET IN TOUCH','2026-08-05T00:00:00Z') on conflict (document_id,version) do update set content_sha256=excluded.content_sha256,byte_count=excluded.byte_count,extracted_text=excluded.extracted_text;
