Page description: Explore the festivals and events produced by Mestizo Producciones: Gijón Sound, Holi Party Festival, OBA Festival, Las Músicas, Electrosonic, Aquasella, Santander Music, Mundaka Festival, and Bay of Biscay.

FESTIVALS & EVENTSFESTIVALS&EVENTS25 years transforming culture through musicFrom intimate gatherings to massive celebrations — Mestizo ProduccionesGIJÓN SOUNDAn annual urban music festival transforming Gijón through electronic and contemporary sounds. A platform for innovation, collaboration, and cultural development that has become a reference in the Spanish festival scene.ELECTRONICURBANGIJÓNSINCE 2015IN THE SPOTLIGHTGIJÓN SOUND FESTIVALWE BELIEVE INTHE POWEROF CULTURECities are constantly changing. Their raw material is ideas.We face the future through collaboration. We think about a different future: innovative, inclusive, participatory, committed, and sustainable.Identity, cooperation, sustainability, effort, creativity, innovation, and territorial development are the VALUES we champion at Gijón Sound.WE ARE A PLATFORM OF EXPERIENCESWe collaborate and draw inspiration from different entities, institutions, companies and collectives of the city, jointly seeking solutions and proposals for new challenges.2023 EDITIONGIJÓN SOUND2023A celebration of electronic and urban music that transformed the city through collaborative experiences and cutting-edge performances.2024 EDITIONGIJÓN SOUND2024Expanding horizons with innovative performances, immersive experiences, and a deep commitment to sustainable and inclusive cultural development.2025 EDITIONGIJÓN SOUND2025The future is now. Experience the most ambitious edition yet, featuring groundbreaking artists and pushing the boundaries of what an urban music festival can be.→BE PART OFTHE CHANGECulture transforms cities. Ideas shape the future.More events coming soonOUR LEGACYPASTFESTIVALSCelebrating the festivals that shaped our journeyHOLI PARTYA vibrant celebration inspired by the Indian festival of colors. Music, art, and thousands of participants creating a kaleidoscope of joy and community connection.COLORCELEBRATIONOBA FESTIVALA multidisciplinary festival celebrating contemporary culture, bringing together music, art, and urban expression in a unique creative environment.MULTIDISCIPLINARYCONTEMPORARYLAS MÚSICASCelebrating musical diversity and cultural exchange. A journey through sounds from around the world, connecting traditions and contemporary expressions.WORLD MUSICDIVERSITY⚡ELECTROSONICPure electronic energy. A festival dedicated to the cutting edge of electronic music, showcasing both established names and emerging talent in the scene.ELECTRONICINNOVATION🌊AQUASELLANature meets music in this legendary electronic festival. Set in stunning natural surroundings, Aquasella has become a pilgrimage for electronic music lovers.NATUREELECTRONICSANTANDER MUSICA coastal celebration of independent and alternative music. Bringing together the best national and international acts in the heart of Santander.INDIESANTANDER🏄MUNDAKA FESTIVALWhere surf culture meets music. Celebrating the laid-back lifestyle of the Basque coast with an eclectic mix of live performances and good vibes.SURFBASQUE COUNTRYBAY OF BISCAYA sonic journey along the northern coast. Showcasing the rich musical heritage and contemporary sounds of the Bay of Biscay region.COASTALNORTHERN SPAINWORK WITH USBRING YOUR EVENT TO LIFE25 years of experience producing unforgettable festivalsYour NameEmailCompany (Optional)MessageSEND MESSAGE','2026-08-05T00:00:00Z') on conflict (document_id,version) do update set content_sha256=excluded.content_sha256,byte_count=excluded.byte_count,extracted_text=excluded.extracted_text;
