n QueridaAnnie B Sweet!!! (Chk Chk Chk)FanfarloLa Casa AzulClap Your Hands Say YeahThe Pains of Being Pure at HeartThe Ting TingsJames MurphyRussian RedHATEMTulsaThe Dandy WarholsVive la FêteWhite LiesSunset SonsLos PlanetasNothing But ThievesM.WardRooseveltTriánguloAND MANY MORE...3000+ nights of pure music magic♪FROMGARAGESTO GLORYSINCE 2000For a quarter of a century, Mestizo Producciones has been the beating heart of music and culture in northern Spain. Over 3,000 gigs, countless stories, and a simple belief: great music deserves to be heard, whether it''s a newcomer playing to 20 people or Bob Dylan commanding thousands.THE CREATORSJosé Luis QuirósFounder & Co-Director of Mestizo | Co-Founder & Music Ringleader at LA PIPA★From Garages to Global StagesWe''ve worked with artists at every stage of their journey. The nervous first-timer, the breakthrough act, the legendary headliner—Pet Shop Boys, Lenny Kravitz, and everyone in between. Every show matters. Every artist gets the same care, the same passion, the same respect.CHAPTER 01More Than Just ConcertsAt LA PIPA, gigs are gatherings. Music is community. Whether it''s an intimate acoustic set under the trees or a full-scale production, we create spaces where people connect—with the music, with each other, with something bigger than themselves.CHAPTER 02★WHAT WE DOOURSERVICESFrom concept to stage — we make it happenPRODUCTIONWe specialize in the planning, production, and organization of all types of musical and cultural events.Full event production from concept to executionTechnical management and logistics coordinationCreative direction and programmingFestivals, concerts, and cultural experiences01BOOKINGWe offer artist booking services for concerts and festivals produced by third parties.Artist sourcing and contract negotiationCurated talent roster from emerging to legendary25 years of industry relationships and expertiseInternational and national acts booking02FEATURED SERVICECOLOSALModernizing MusicOur personal contribution to the modernization of music.We promote and facilitate the creation of spaces equipped with modern infrastructure that allows recording and generating attractive, high-quality audiovisual content.State-of-the-art recording studiosProfessional audiovisual production facilitiesHigh-quality multimedia content creationDigital-first content strategy and distributionResponding to modern multimedia consumption trendsTHE FUTURE OF MUSIC PRODUCTION03"Every show is a story.Let us help you tell yours."READY?LET''S MAKE NOISEBOOK A SHOWGet in touch / Start the conversation / Join the lineup','2026-08-05T00:00:00Z') on conflict (document_id,version) do update set content_sha256=excluded.content_sha256,byte_count=excluded.byte_count,extracted_text=excluded.extracted_text;
