Page description: Transform your marketing with AI by Design, privacy-first audience activation, cross-media planning, and data-driven creativity. Services that combine human intelligence with ethical AI.

POST-DIGITALCAPABILITIESIntelligence, creativity, and systems — designed for humans01Intelligence that serves creativityAI BY DESIGNAI at LA PIPA begins with people, not data. We build systems where intelligence serves creativity and ethics. Human-in-the-loop design frameworks, predictive and generative content workflows, Applied Humanized Intelligence™, AI-driven insight and automation design, privacy-by-default and ethical AI audits.→ Technology guided by human empathy, curiosity, and context.02Cross-media ecosystemsMEDIA PLANNING & BUYINGWe blend the art of storytelling with the science of media, orchestrating campaigns across traditional and digital channels. TV, Print, Radio, OOH, VTV, CTV, OTT, YouTube, Amazon, TikTok Shop, Meta Commerce, Google Ads, Programmatic DSPs, contextual targeting.→ Data by Design — decisions informed by insight, not intuition alone.03Activate your communityFIRST-PARTY AUDIENCE ACTIVATIONWe help brands activate their own audiences — ethically, intelligently, and independently. Consent-based data collection (GDPR & ePrivacy compliant), CRM/CDP strategy, segmentation, lookalike modeling, audience mapping, first-party activation via email, programmatic, and social.→ Privacy by Design — humans remain in control of their data and experiences.04Where design meets intelligenceSTRATEGY, DESIGN & KNOWLEDGE SYSTEMSA knowledge-driven studio that crafts systems, stories, and services for the post-digital era. We merge brand strategy, data science, and human experience into living ecosystems. Experience & Service Design, Brand Architecture & Story Systems, Media Intelligence & Market Strategy, Data-informed Creativity & Measurement.→ Open innovation and ''We is the new Me'' ethos.Explore MoreContactLet''s talk about your project','2026-08-05T00:00:00Z') on conflict (document_id,version) do update set content_sha256=excluded.content_sha256,byte_count=excluded.byte_count,extracted_text=excluded.extracted_text;
