Page description: Where underground music meets community at LA PIPA. Raw live sessions, emerging artists, and collaborative experiments in an intimate basement venue. Music without filters.

SUBTERRANEAUNDERGROUND EXPERIMENTSWhere music meets communityWHERE IT HAPPENSWHERE MUSICMEETSCOMMUNITYMúsica, artistas, ideas, creadores, y comunidad—all colliding in unexpected ways.LISTEN TO PODCAST →WATCH MORE100 SONGS FOR10 YEARSA decade-long sonic journey curated by Alex Lawton. From Barcelona to Madrid and across the globe, each year brought new discoveries—music that would define the legendary Subterránea parties at El Patio de la Favorita in Gijón every December 28th.When El Patio closed its doors, Alex distilled ten years of Christmas sessions into one definitive collection: the 10 most essential tracks from each year. This is Subterránea—the music Alex discovered and played on that night over a decade.A DECADEUNDERGROUNDEXPERIMENTSMUSIC × FANS × WEB3La Evolución delFenómeno FanNatalia Cisterna explores the transformation of fan culture in the web3 eraTHE FUTUREExplore MoreLaPipa TalksConversationsDeadprogramOpen source series','2026-08-05T00:00:00Z') on conflict (document_id,version) do update set content_sha256=excluded.content_sha256,byte_count=excluded.byte_count,extracted_text=excluded.extracted_text;
