Page description: Terms and conditions for using LA PIPA''s services and website. Learn about your rights and responsibilities when engaging with our community and platform.

Terms of ServiceLast Updated: January 2025IntroductionWelcome to LA PIPA. These Terms of Service ("Terms") govern your access to and use of our website, services, and community spaces. By accessing or using LA PIPA''s services, you agree to be bound by these Terms.1. Acceptance of TermsBy accessing and using our services, you accept and agree to be bound by these Terms and our Privacy Policy. If you do not agree to these Terms, please do not use our services.2. Description of ServicesLA PIPA provides:Community spaces for learning, collaboration, and knowledge sharingCreative services including studio facilities and production supportEvent spaces and coordination for cultural and educational activitiesFood and beverage services through our kitchen clubDigital platform for content, resources, and community connection3. User ResponsibilitiesWhen using our services, you agree to:Provide accurate and complete information when requiredRespect the rights and dignity of other community membersUse our facilities and services responsibly and safelyComply with all applicable laws and regulationsNot engage in any activity that disrupts or interferes with our servicesRespect intellectual property rights of LA PIPA and others4. Intellectual PropertyAll content, materials, and services provided by LA PIPA, including but not limited to text, graphics, logos, images, audio, video, and software, are the property of LA PIPA or its licensors and are protected by copyright, trademark, and other intellectual property laws.You may not reproduce, distribute, modify, or create derivative works from our content without explicit written permission from LA PIPA.5. Community GuidelinesLA PIPA is committed to maintaining a welcoming, inclusive, and respectful environment. We do not tolerate:Harassment, discrimination, or hate speech of any kindViolence or threats of violenceIllegal activities or promotion thereofSpam, fraud, or deceptive practicesViolation of others'' privacy or intellectual property rightsWe reserve the right to remove any user or content that violates these guidelines.6. Bookings and PaymentsFor services requiring booking or payment, you agree to provide accurate payment information and authorize charges for services rendered. Cancellation policies vary by service and will be communicated at the time of booking.7. Limitation of LiabilityLA PIPA provides services "as is" without warranties of any kind. We are not liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising from your use of our services.Our total liability for any claims related to our services shall not exceed the amount you paid for the specific service giving rise to the claim.8. Privacy and Data ProtectionYour use of our services is also governed by our Privacy Policy. By using our services, you consent to our collection and use of your data as described in our Privacy Policy.9. Modifications to Services and TermsWe reserve the right to modify, suspend, or discontinue any part of our services at any time. We may also update these Terms from time to time. Continued use of our services after changes constitutes acceptance of the modified Terms.10. TerminationWe reserve the right to terminate or suspend your access to our services at our sole discretion, without notice, for conduct that we believe violates these Terms or is harmful to other users, us, or third parties.11. Governing LawThese Terms are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of Spain. Any disputes arising from these Terms or your use of our services shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of Spain.Contact UsIf you have questions about these Terms of Service, please contact us:Email: legal@lapipa.ioAddress: LA PIPA, Poio, Pontevedra, SpainImportant NoticeBy using LA PIPA''s services, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. These Terms constitute a legally binding agreement between you and LA PIPA.','2026-08-05T00:00:00Z') on conflict (document_id,version) do update set content_sha256=excluded.content_sha256,byte_count=excluded.byte_count,extracted_text=excluded.extracted_text;
