insert into kb.chunks (chunk_id,document_version_id,ordinal,heading_path,content,token_count,content_sha256,language,verification_status,access_scope,active,metadata) values ('LP-WEB-LEGACY-16-DOC-CH-002',(select dv.id from kb.document_versions dv join kb.documents d on d.id=dv.document_id where d.document_id='LP-WEB-LEGACY-16-DOC' and dv.version='2025-10-20-export'),1,'Making change happen in 2024-2026','conviction. There are many moments when our beliefs and strategies are met with skepticism, and mockery, and times when the temptation of giving up and going for the easier path to conform to industry norms and easier ways forward, is hard to resist.However, the recognition from several international portals and specialized press in the last weeks serves as a powerful affirmation of our approach. It validates the hard work and dedication of our core teams and reinforces our belief in the value of pursuing innovation on our own terms.The Importance of RecognitionIn an industry that often prioritizes rapid growth, scalability, and exit strategies, our inclusion in international lists of “top companies to watch” or “top companies reshaping the industry” is a testament to the mid to long-term viability and impact of an alternative approach to business and technological innovation. It demonstrates that there is space and indeed a need for companies that prioritize their vision and values over conventional technology / digital start-up metrics of success over the last 2 decades.Recognition is incredibly meaningful. It''s a nod to our journey of staying independent, self-funded, and committed to our ideals. It encourages us to continue on our path of organic growth, constantly innovating and challenging the status quo, while remaining true to the principles that define us. So from here, I wanted to say thanks to those journalists out there who are following our work and reiterate that we are grateful for these international acknowledgments, which give us strength to remain dedicated to making a significant impact in the fields of machine learning, AI, Post Digital Marketing & Media, and creative innovation.People, Planet, PurposeThanks for reading.Alex',444,'79b65c606805f8d29330b2a1bf7c1ed908ede48b1f2424e5471c6ebee1ca9b66','en','historically_published_capture','public',true,'{"chunk_profile":"LP-RAG-CHUNK-1.0","max_characters":3600,"overlap_characters":400,"token_count_method":"ceil_utf16_characters_divided_by_4"}'::jsonb) on conflict (chunk_id) do update set content=excluded.content,token_count=excluded.token_count,content_sha256=excluded.content_sha256,verification_status=excluded.verification_status,access_scope=excluded.access_scope,active=true,metadata=excluded.metadata,updated_at=now();
