Post Digital Media Open collaboration, breaking down myths of the Media Industry over the last two decades

[ { "type": "highlight", "id": "61593939-496f-4b80-9b98-da9693102b9e", "shape": "underline", "isFront": false, "isAnimationEnabled": false, "animation": "draw", "duration": 0.5, "direction": "right", "color": { "type": "THEME_COLOR" }, "thickness": { "unit": "em", "value": 0.1 }, "linecap": "square" }, { "type": "highlight", "id": "36690cb0-7a6b-4fd6-8b26-d8441d706242", "shape": "underline", "isFront": false, "isAnimationEnabled": false, "animation": "draw", "duration": 0.5, "direction": "right", "color": { "type": "THEME_COLOR" }, "thickness": { "unit": "em", "value": 0.1 }, "linecap": "square" }, { "type": "highlight", "id": "e17c44da-96b3-4693-9b34-f09681e5b0b6", "shape": "underline", "isFront": false, "isAnimationEnabled": false, "animation": "draw", "duration": 0.5, "direction": "right", "color": { "type": "THEME_COLOR" }, "thickness": { "unit": "em", "value": 0.1 }, "linecap": "square" }, { "type": "highlight", "id": "9f73ef3f-2e3c-4036-92ee-0dbd495c75a4", "shape": "underline", "isFront": false, "isAnimationEnabled": false, "animation": "draw", "duration": 0.5, "direction": "right", "color": { "type": "THEME_COLOR" }, "thickness": { "unit": "em", "value": 0.1 }, "linecap": "square" } ] In the MEDIA AND MARKETING INDUSTRY misconceptions often hinder progress and innovation. the need for new ways of thinking and working has never been more apparent. traditional debates between independent agencies OR large holding groups, and the misconceptions surrounding them, have limited the scope of opportunities for brands WHO ARE FORCED TO CHOOSE ONE OR ANOTHER, renouncing VALUABLE OPPORTUNITIES IN THE PROCESSAs I have shared in previous articles, it´s my view that the fusion of humanistic research with data science is changing the game of connecting with consumers. It''s not about choosing between numbers and stories but understanding that both are important. Likewise, being able to choose partners from the Holding Co and Independent world at the same time and expecting them to collaborate openly and leave an old-school industry debate that is self-serving and not client-serving behind is equally important.Embracing Change in Media: The Power of New Partnerships and Trust-Based Open CollaborationThe rise of new entities such as R&D and science-based firms, Open Innovation and collaboration Hubs, and Science and Technology Parks, alongside post-digital strategy agencies, presents an exciting opportunity to redefine media partnerships.',761,'7839b3d04f60aa57a7d2cbbc8d5ea8a3766d0e30ce0d4c5f124d4fd0936eaf97','en','historically_published_capture','public',true,'{"chunk_profile":"LP-RAG-CHUNK-1.0","max_characters":3600,"overlap_characters":400,"token_count_method":"ceil_utf16_characters_divided_by_4"}'::jsonb) on conflict (chunk_id) do update set content=excluded.content,token_count=excluded.token_count,content_sha256=excluded.content_sha256,verification_status=excluded.verification_status,access_scope=excluded.access_scope,active=true,metadata=excluded.metadata,updated_at=now();
