Page description: We''re not your typical agency. LA PIPA combines humanized AI, first-party data intelligence, and bold creativity to build the future of marketing from a cider mill in Asturias. ABOUTUSEST. NOWA living question?LA PIPA IS LA PIPAWhat We AreMISSIONWe''re an AI-native creative studio focused on collective intelligence. We build tools, platforms, and experiences that amplify human creativity through technology. We''re not a traditional agency. We''re a collective of builders, thinkers, and makers who believe in first principles and practicing the art.PIECE BY PIECEA HAVEN FORCLEVER MISFITSClever misfits. Restless founders. People who question everything and build anyway. If you''re tired of incremental thinking and ready to build something fundamentally different, you''re in the right place.★Collective intelligence over individual genius. First principles over best practices. Building over talking. We believe the future isn''t predicted—it''s built by those brave enough to wonder out loud and smart enough to turn those wonders into reality.Building the Future Through Collective IntelligenceWHAT WEBELIEVECOLLECTIVE INTELLIGENCEBy invitation, not instructionPRACTICE THE ARTWe build it, piece by unlikely pieceTHE MYSTERYYou won''t find the full story hereFernando Ferrao embodies the balance between belief and action. A lifelong surfer and former business professional, he left a successful corporate path to follow his true calling—the ocean. Alongside his surf career, he holds degrees in Business Administration, Marketing, Psychology, and Physical Education, blending strategic insight with a deep understanding of human potential. Through his teaching and mentorship, Fernando helps others reconnect with purpose, overcome fear, and pursue what truly moves them. For him, surfing is more than a sport—it''s a way to believe, to do, and to live fully.!WE''RE HERE TO WONDEROUT LOUDTransformación del Marketing Post-Digital con Javier Roces – Carolina Herrera Beauty 🎯En esta conversación, exploramos la evolución del marketing y los medios en la era post-digital a través de la visión de Javier, un líder clave en la industria de la belleza y el lujo.Desde sus inicios en Procter & Gamble, su pasión por la moda y la belleza lo llevó a Puig, donde ha liderado marcas icónicas como Carolina Herrera Beauty, Nina Ricci y Comme des Garçons. Actualmente, como Vicepresidente de Carolina Herrera Beauty & Licencias, Javier es un referente en innovación y estrategia de marca.LET''S CREATETOGETHERReady to start a conversation? Drop us a line.Your NameEmailCompany (Optional)MessageSEND MESSAGEExplore MoreStudioWhere ideas become realityPeopleThe minds behind LaPIPAContactLet''s talk',713,'752a2a348abed9f8a841205ebc1b1f74263c302def4890795a7a0a18ebb8cc34','en','captured_public_claim','public',true,'{"chunk_profile":"LP-RAG-CHUNK-1.0","max_characters":3600,"overlap_characters":400,"token_count_method":"ceil_utf16_characters_divided_by_4"}'::jsonb) on conflict (chunk_id) do update set content=excluded.content,token_count=excluded.token_count,content_sha256=excluded.content_sha256,verification_status=excluded.verification_status,access_scope=excluded.access_scope,active=true,metadata=excluded.metadata,updated_at=now();
