Page description: The framework that guides LA PIPA''s approach to collaboration, learning, and knowledge sharing. Clarity first, human-centered design, and collective intelligence. AboutKnowledge PrinciplesKNOWLEDGEPRINCIPLESThe foundation of everything we buildCORE VALUES01CLARITY FIRSTCut through complexity to find the essential truth. Every project begins with crystal-clear understanding.02AI NATIVEWe don''t just use AI—we think AI-first. Every process is designed with intelligence at its core.03REUSABLE MODULARBuilding blocks that work seamlessly. Scalable systems that grow and adapt with your needs.04DOCUMENT EVERYTHINGKnowledge is power when shared. We capture every decision, process, and insight for collective wisdom.HOW WEDOCUMENTVIDEOVisual captureAUDIOConversationsTEXTWritten guidesCODELiving examples',257,'bbc5f61de2802b018f80be126609e045895e3e8cc6a910278584f8911186fa73','en','captured_public_claim','public',true,'{"chunk_profile":"LP-RAG-CHUNK-1.0","max_characters":3600,"overlap_characters":400,"token_count_method":"ceil_utf16_characters_divided_by_4"}'::jsonb) on conflict (chunk_id) do update set content=excluded.content,token_count=excluded.token_count,content_sha256=excluded.content_sha256,verification_status=excluded.verification_status,access_scope=excluded.access_scope,active=true,metadata=excluded.metadata,updated_at=now();
