Page description: Meet the minds behind LA PIPA - contributors, collaborators, and clever misfits driving innovation and creative excellence. AboutPeopleTHEPEOPLEContributors, collaborators, clever misfits24 MINDS01Co-Founder & CreatorAlex LawtonThe creator of LA PIPA is a futurist and media expert with over 25 years of experience leading global and local media agencies. A true innovator and entrepreneur, Alex thrives on curiosity and a drive to push boundaries. His deep industry expertise and forward-thinking approach have put agencies at the forefront of the media business, making him a force in creating new opportunities in this moment of fast, Post-Digital change.★02Co-FounderDavid DeibeDr. Deibe is an expert in data processing. He earned his PhD in Information Technologies Research from the Universidade da Coruña, Spain. He has contributed significantly to the development of efficient data structures and algorithms for handling massive datasets, particularly in the visualisation and processing of point clouds. With experience in both academic research and private business, David has pioneered tools for data visualization and big data storage solutions across multiple sectors, from shipping and naval industries to marketing and media. Currently, David continues to contribute to innovative projects in data engineering and computer vision, advancing the boundaries of marketing and media data science, engineering, ML and AI, as well as providing the backbone for more sustainable advanced analytics.★03Co-FounderDory CasasThe inspiring female force among the founders, blending her deep expertise in media planning and activation, with her passion for nature, sustainability, food sovereignty, and permaculture. As a champion of these causes, Dory drives our commitment to creating conscious solutions that align with the values of our clients and the future of our planet. Her innovative mindset and dedication to regenerative practices inspire our team to incorporate sustainability into every aspect of what we do.★04Leadership & Organizational TransformationFrancesca GabettiFrancesca is a visionary leader with a deep commitment to organizational transformation, leadership development, and the promotion of conscious business practices. She leverages her expertise to help organizations enhance team performance through data-driven insights and emotional intelligence. Francesca has also played key roles in global movements like Women in Tech and Conscious Capitalism, advocating for gender diversity in technology and promoting business models that prioritize ethical leadership and social impact. Her work bridges innovation with purpose, empowering teams and organizations to thrive in an ever-evolving business landscape.★05Lead Sound DesignerEulogioHe is an artist, promoter, and entrepreneur with over 30 years in the music industry, blending his deep experience with cutting-edge sound design and music production. As the lead sound designer at LA PIPA Studios and ReMotive Media, Eulogio ensures that every audiovisual LA PIPA project features original soundscapes he and his dedicated team crafted. His passion for music production and live performance drives him to create unique audio experiences that elevate the content for brands and immersive projects.',866,'67885714d92cc5fbd8eb940949a6594e7bbd68d6f4e6000d14b368287d26c3e6','en','captured_public_claim','public',true,'{"chunk_profile":"LP-RAG-CHUNK-1.0","max_characters":3600,"overlap_characters":400,"token_count_method":"ceil_utf16_characters_divided_by_4"}'::jsonb) on conflict (chunk_id) do update set content=excluded.content,token_count=excluded.token_count,content_sha256=excluded.content_sha256,verification_status=excluded.verification_status,access_scope=excluded.access_scope,active=true,metadata=excluded.metadata,updated_at=now();
