insert into kb.chunks (chunk_id,document_version_id,ordinal,heading_path,content,token_count,content_sha256,language,verification_status,access_scope,active,metadata) values ('LP-WEB-LIVE-ABOUT-PEOPLE-DOC-CH-002',(select dv.id from kb.document_versions dv join kb.documents d on d.id=dv.document_id where d.document_id='LP-WEB-LIVE-ABOUT-PEOPLE-DOC' and dv.version='2026-08-05-capture'),1,'People — LA PIPA','e with cutting-edge sound design and music production. As the lead sound designer at LA PIPA Studios and ReMotive Media, Eulogio ensures that every audiovisual LA PIPA project features original soundscapes he and his dedicated team crafted. His passion for music production and live performance drives him to create unique audio experiences that elevate the content for brands and immersive projects. This phase of his career focuses on pushing creative boundaries while maintaining a commitment to high-quality, original sound design.★06Co-FounderJosé Luis QuirósJosé Luis is a visionary in the music industry, renowned for co-founding LA PIPA, a significant initiative aimed at revolutionizing music and cultural experiences. In addition to his innovative work with LA PIPA, he serves as the managing partner of Mestizo Producciones, where he oversees numerous projects that blend music, art, and culture. His leadership extends to directing the Gijón Sound Festival, where he curates a dynamic mix of international and local talent, further establishing his influence on the Spanish and global music scenes.★07Media & Marketing StrategistKoen SmeetsKoen Smeets is an accomplished media and marketing strategist with a wealth of global experience. He previously held the role of Global Strategy Director at Dentsu-Aegis and Starcom (London), where he honed his expertise in driving business growth and media innovation for top-tier brands. After moving to Spain, Koen led Performance Strategy across EMEA for DAC Group, further solidifying his reputation for excellence in performance-driven media. His entrepreneurial spirit ultimately led him to co-found ReMotive Media, where he continues to push boundaries in media strategy and long-term brand growth.★08Co-Founder & Open Source RingleaderRon EvansA leading figure in the open-source and IoT community. As the co-founder of LA PIPA, he plays a pivotal role in shaping the platform''s innovative direction. He is also the Open Source Ringleader, overseeing LA PIPA''s Hack Space, where he fosters a collaborative environment for creators and developers to push technological boundaries. Evans is best known for his contributions to the global IoT and robotics community. He is the creator of Gobot, a widely-used open-source framework for robotics and IoT, and GoCV, a Go-based framework for computer vision. Additionally, he is creator and maintainer of TinyGo, a compiler that brings the Go programming language to embedded systems and microcontrollers, making significant strides in IoT development. His thought leadership and technical innovations have earned him recognition at major conferences like FOSDEM and MakerFaire, and he has been instrumental in helping companies like AT&T and Intel tackle complex IoT challenges.★09Co-FounderSergio MaldonadoSergio is a data privacy expert with a proven track record in leading digital transformation. Known for his deep expertise in data management and privacy regulations, he pioneers privacy-first media solutions that drive innovation, and craft trust-driven strategies, ensuring brands navigate the evolving digital landscape ethically.★K10Co-Founder, Mestizo Producciones & LA PIPA StudiosKiko RimadaCo-Founder of Mestizo Producciones, musician, and co-creator of LA PIPA Studios, Kiko is a natural native in the Spanish independent music scene. Also known for his one of a kind band like Los Guajes, he blends cultural influences to create unique, dynamic sounds.',869,'6f515360e852762beeea9a637df9ccc917d56642acca12630022050d414db988','en','captured_public_claim','public',true,'{"chunk_profile":"LP-RAG-CHUNK-1.0","max_characters":3600,"overlap_characters":400,"token_count_method":"ceil_utf16_characters_divided_by_4"}'::jsonb) on conflict (chunk_id) do update set content=excluded.content,token_count=excluded.token_count,content_sha256=excluded.content_sha256,verification_status=excluded.verification_status,access_scope=excluded.access_scope,active=true,metadata=excluded.metadata,updated_at=now();
