insert into kb.chunks (chunk_id,document_version_id,ordinal,heading_path,content,token_count,content_sha256,language,verification_status,access_scope,active,metadata) values ('LP-WEB-LIVE-ABOUT-PEOPLE-DOC-CH-003',(select dv.id from kb.document_versions dv join kb.documents d on d.id=dv.document_id where d.document_id='LP-WEB-LIVE-ABOUT-PEOPLE-DOC' and dv.version='2026-08-05-capture'),2,'People — LA PIPA','ies, ensuring brands navigate the evolving digital landscape ethically.★K10Co-Founder, Mestizo Producciones & LA PIPA StudiosKiko RimadaCo-Founder of Mestizo Producciones, musician, and co-creator of LA PIPA Studios, Kiko is a natural native in the Spanish independent music scene. Also known for his one of a kind band like Los Guajes, he blends cultural influences to create unique, dynamic sounds. As the co-director of the Gijón Sound Festival, Kiko has helped shape a vibrant music community, promoting both local and international talent. His passion for music production and fostering creative collaboration continues to thrive through LA PIPA Studios, a hub for content driven and streaming initiatives.★R11Founder, Ricardo Crispin & Co MotorsRicardo (Richard) CrispinRichard is a valued member of the community and the founder of Ricardo Crispin & Co Motors, a boutique operation dedicated to the curation of classic and modern classic vehicles. With a reputation built on precision, integrity, and an instinctive understanding of automotive value, Ricardo brings decades of hands-on experience to every acquisition, combining market insight with a deep appreciation for craftsmanship and design.★J12Proptech ExpertJaime PireJaime is an expert in the proptech sector, with a strong focus on integrating technology into real estate and facilities management. His expertise includes utilising digital tools and innovative solutions to streamline property management, enhance facilities operations, and improve overall efficiency. Jaime is dedicated to helping businesses adopt advanced technologies that optimize processes, making both property and facilities management more agile, cost-effective, and customer-centric.★A13VFX Artist & LA PIPA Co-CreatorAlonso VarelaAlonso is an accomplished VFX artist with an extensive portfolio that includes major films such as Ex Machina (2014), Valerian and the City of a Thousand Planets (2017), Geostorm (2017), and War for the Planet of the Apes (2017), showcasing his expertise in creating visually complex and award-winning effects. His work extends to popular TV series like The Boys (2022), and many others. Beyond his long list of achievements, Alonso is an untold force behind the creation of LA PIPA, who spent many years discussing vision and ideas with Alex Lawton, of who he is a lifelong friend. At LA PIPA he focuses on collaborating towards transferring his knowledge to people in other fields, and helping young talents find their path in the global VFX industry continuing to make an impact, as a creator and also as a guide for emerging artists.★N14Business Development & Impact InvestingNacho HuiciA powerhouse in business development and impact investing, Ignacio brings sharp strategy and unstoppable energy to LA PIPA. With deep roots in sustainable energy, and open innovation, he''s driving the future through green hydrogen, storage, and solar PV projects. A natural connector with a killer network, Ignacio''s passion for startups, tech, and smart capital is matched only by his mission: building a better, more sustainable world for the next generation. Business angel, venture builder, and all-around great human being—he''s making EIT InnoEnergy''s vision a reality, and we''re very lucky to have him in our community!★B15CoordinatorBea SandeBeatriz is a star who coordinates everything at LA PIPA thanks to her ability to make complex tasks seem simple and always maintaining a positive attitude, even under heavy workloads.',875,'f44c810271cbf6ad31ebebf55d5022012f3a103df8bb4e70dd8e179011c50399','en','captured_public_claim','public',true,'{"chunk_profile":"LP-RAG-CHUNK-1.0","max_characters":3600,"overlap_characters":400,"token_count_method":"ceil_utf16_characters_divided_by_4"}'::jsonb) on conflict (chunk_id) do update set content=excluded.content,token_count=excluded.token_count,content_sha256=excluded.content_sha256,verification_status=excluded.verification_status,access_scope=excluded.access_scope,active=true,metadata=excluded.metadata,updated_at=now();
