Page description: 25 years of Mestizo Producciones promoting music and culture in northern Spain. Over 3,000 gigs from newcomer artists to global headliners like Bob Dylan and Pet Shop Boys. LIVEMUSICMESTIZO × LA PIPAMestizo Producciones × LA PIPA25Years Strong3000+Gigs & Counting∞Stories ToldWALL OF LEGENDSTHEYTRUSTEDUSOver 25 years of music history. Every artist, every night.Lenny KravitzPet Shop BoysBob DylanCalvin HarrisRicky MartinArthur Lee (LOVE)Joe SatrianiThe WaterboysThe BuzzcocksSt. Paul & the Broken BonesJames RhodesThe StranglersLunaThe JayhawksTindersticksLos EnemigosCocoRosieBelle & SebastianMando DiaoRobeFito & Los FitipaldisQuique GonzálezDonovanRival SonsHermanoThe DamnedNick LoweLa Habitación RojaVetusta MorlaNikki HillAra MalikianLendakaris MuertosMClanThe VaccinesVicente AmigoRinoceroçeGlen HansardLori MeyersTen FéLove of LesbianDorianSidonieDeloreanJulieta VenegasManelEscuchando ElefantesJoe CrespúsculoNovedades CarminhaLos BengalaIzalSecondMiami HorrorBelizeLa M.O.D.APaul Collins BeatPeraltaSiniestro TotalBird of JoyBelakoCaptainsBerri TxarrakLuis Eduardo AuteL.APauline en la PlayaFlamin'' GrooviesNiño de ElcheFasenuovaFrank TurnerJim Jones RevueKula ShakerThe Tallest Man on EarthThe SonicsImperial State ElectricRick AstleyEl Columpio AsesinoMonarchySupersubmarinaCrystal FightersLa RouxIs TropicalSatellite StoriesXoel LópezNeumanDeluxeCitizensRadio BirdmanMatthew HerbertScott MatthewThe ShipsTrajano!Dave AlvinPhil AlvinFuture IslandsThe Wave PicturesIván Ferreiro2 Many DJsGlass AnimalsStandstillLeón BenaventeKeaneThe BrightDoverWilly MoonFangoriaReptil YouthJamaicaJon Spencer Blues ExplosionDanko JonesJuan PerroMicah P. HinsonZoéJosh RouseHowe GelbJulio de la RosaLuz CasalWe Are ScientistsMark LaneganThe PosiesThe SheepdogsSoul JacketThe FleshtonesCápsulaLeivaPerezaThe CynicsDayna KurtzLagartija NickMala RodríguezTote KingHeavy TrashFishboneDatsunsKiko VenenoLambchopCalexicoThe Beasts Of BourbonHombres GCanto del LocoNashville PussyDrive-By TruckersMother SuperiorSupagroupMártires del CompásJohnny KaplanThe Lazy StarsDiamond DogsMatthew SweetSupersuckersJosele SantiagoEl BichoRaimundo AmadorChambaoThe CharlatansFuel FandangoLa Bien QueridaAnnie B Sweet!!! (Chk Chk Chk)FanfarloLa Casa AzulClap Your Hands Say YeahThe Pains of Being Pure at HeartThe Ting TingsJames MurphyRussian RedHATEMTulsaThe Dandy WarholsVive la FêteWhite LiesSunset SonsLos PlanetasNothing But ThievesM.WardRooseveltTriánguloAND MANY MORE...3000+ nights of pure music magic♪FROMGARAGESTO GLORYSINCE 2000For a quarter of a century, Mestizo Producciones has been the beating heart of music and culture in northern Spain. Over 3,000 gigs, countless stories, and a simple belief: great music deserves to be heard, whether it''s a newcomer playing to 20 people or Bob Dylan commanding thousands.THE CREATORSJosé Luis QuirósFounder & Co-Director of Mestizo | Co-Founder & Music Ringleader at LA PIPA★From Garages to Global StagesWe''ve worked with artists at every stage of their journey. The nervous first-timer, the breakthrough act, the legendary headliner—Pet Shop Boys, Lenny Kravitz, and everyone in between. Every show matters. Every artist gets the same care, the same passion, the same respect.CHAPTER 01More Than Just ConcertsAt LA PIPA, gigs are gatherings. Music is community.',870,'80ba5c73249be5c2d3a1a25a80a1fc1dd64fa32bde4d043fd19139fdd3b35244','en','captured_public_claim','public',true,'{"chunk_profile":"LP-RAG-CHUNK-1.0","max_characters":3600,"overlap_characters":400,"token_count_method":"ceil_utf16_characters_divided_by_4"}'::jsonb) on conflict (chunk_id) do update set content=excluded.content,token_count=excluded.token_count,content_sha256=excluded.content_sha256,verification_status=excluded.verification_status,access_scope=excluded.access_scope,active=true,metadata=excluded.metadata,updated_at=now();
