Page description: Our portfolio blends heritage preservation with cutting-edge AI: XENTE''s wisdom documentation, luxury hotel RevPAR optimization, steel industry innovation, and data-driven creative campaigns. PortfolioOURWORKProjects that blend heritage, music, data, and wild ideasSELECTED PROJECTS01HeritageXENTEA heritage nonprofit project documenting wisdom and know-how from our elders. Conserving knowledge of traditions and times long gone.Explore ProjectX02Experience DesignLUXURY HOTELSExperience Design, Data, and Media project to increase RevPAR in Luxury Hotels. Consumer journey analytics and strategic media optimization.Watch Case Study03Studio InnovationGONVARRISteel transformation leader since 1958. Integrated approach controlling the entire value chain from raw materials to finished products.Watch Case Study04Data by DesignDURO FELGUERALeading the Board on data application across operations. Comprehensive data science transformation initiative.Watch Case Study4Featured Projects100+Total Projects12Industries5+Years Experience',304,'2856ce8cd5b44ab1717d0ef272645f629502cfd98e31be196a3f910448f968de','en','captured_public_claim','public',true,'{"chunk_profile":"LP-RAG-CHUNK-1.0","max_characters":3600,"overlap_characters":400,"token_count_method":"ceil_utf16_characters_divided_by_4"}'::jsonb) on conflict (chunk_id) do update set content=excluded.content,token_count=excluded.token_count,content_sha256=excluded.content_sha256,verification_status=excluded.verification_status,access_scope=excluded.access_scope,active=true,metadata=excluded.metadata,updated_at=now();
