Page description: Everything handmade at LA PIPA Studio. Original video, photography, music production, and creative content crafted from scratch. No stock libraries. No borrowed sounds. Pure creation. THESTUDIOFROM SCRATCH × IN-HOUSENo stock libraries. No borrowed sounds. Everything handmade.Scroll to discoverTHE ETHOSA STUDIOBUILT FORCREATIONNOT REPLICATIONOur tools are varied, but our purpose is unified: to enable immediate, hands-on creation. Our studio is filled with tactile, expressive instruments that encourage exploration and reward risk.We work with an extensive lineup of synthesizers and instruments—not for the sake of collection, but because they give us the language we need to speak in different voices.IN-HOUSE MEANS AUTHOREDWhen we say "in-house," we don''t just mean "under our roof." We mean authored, performed, captured, and refined by the people in the room.EVERY ELEMENT WITH INTENTIONWe take the time to design a snare drum that punches differently. A reverb tail that feels like memory. A bassline that couldn''t have come from anywhere else.THE ARSENALSONICTOOLSEvery tone, beat, chord, or texture you hear in our work is designed, played, and recorded by us, in-house. Our instruments are not trophies—they''re tools that enable us to speak in different sonic languages.SYNTHESIZERS•Five Moogs (Mother-32s, DFAM, Subharmonicon, Sub 37)•MFB Tanzbär analog drum machine•Polyend Seq & Korg Electribe•Extensive modular systemsINSTRUMENTS•Guitars (electric & acoustic)•Bass guitars•Acoustic drum kits•Hammond XP-8We work inside Bitwig, Logic Pro, and Ableton Live—but we don''t let them dictate the process. They''re simply one layer in a multi-dimensional, physical-digital workflow.★CINEMATICVISIONSHOT × GRADED × EDITEDEverything visual is shot by us, color-graded by us, edited by us. Our audio and visual outputs are deeply integrated—from set design to soundtracking—ensuring consistency and cohesion across formats.EQUIPMENT•Blackmagic Pocket Cinema Cameras (6K and 4K)•Blackmagic Studio Cameras for multicam capture•Professional lighting and studio rigging•GPU-accelerated workflows in DaVinci ResolveLaPiPa is fully equipped for cinematic-grade filming and live multicam performance capture. Every frame matters. Every cut tells a story.OUR MANIFESTOSLOW MEDIAIN A FAST WORLDHANDMADEIN A DIGITAL AGEAt the core of LaPiPa is a refusal to outsource the soul of our work. We believe in creating our own sonic signatures. In building stories, performances, and experiences from scratch.We''re not trying to be perfect. We''re trying to be real. And that means crafting every element with intention.★THE PRINCIPLEORIGINALBY DESIGNIn a world oversaturated with templates, presets, and plug-and-play content, LaPiPa stands for the opposite.We are a creative lab in the truest sense—built to serve the work, not the other way around. Every element we create carries our signature because it was made by our hands, shaped by our choices, and refined through our process.READY TOCREATE?Let''s talk about making something original togetherGET IN TOUCHExplore MoreGigs25 years of musicContactLet''s collaborate',819,'63a4a14c437041be3cde32014f629b9de9030417f08167b27ca117e2af83ec03','en','captured_public_claim','public',true,'{"chunk_profile":"LP-RAG-CHUNK-1.0","max_characters":3600,"overlap_characters":400,"token_count_method":"ceil_utf16_characters_divided_by_4"}'::jsonb) on conflict (chunk_id) do update set content=excluded.content,token_count=excluded.token_count,content_sha256=excluded.content_sha256,verification_status=excluded.verification_status,access_scope=excluded.access_scope,active=true,metadata=excluded.metadata,updated_at=now();
