maker culture.EPISODE 01S2_01_DEADPROGRAM@LA PIPASeason 2 Episode 1EPISODE 02S2_02_DEADPROGRAM@LA PIPASeason 2 Episode 2EPISODE 03S2_03_DEADPROGRAM@LA PIPASeason 2 Episode 3EPISODE 04S2_04_DEADPROGRAM@LA PIPASeason 2 Episode 4EPISODE 05S2_05_DEADPROGRAM@LA PIPASeason 2 Episode 5EPISODE 06S2_06_DEADPROGRAM@LA PIPASeason 2 Episode 6SEASON 02 // MORE EPISODES COMING⚡JOINTHE LABWhether you''re an experienced maker or just getting started, our hackspace welcomes everyone who''s curious and ready to create.GET INVOLVEDOpen nights / Workshops / Build sessionsLEARN•MAKE•SHAREOPEN SOURCE × OPEN MINDS[ ORIGIN STORY // 2019 ]The essence of Open SourceRon Evans at LA PIPA on one of the Hackspace''s first days in 2019[ GET INVOLVED ]Join the LabInterested in collaborating, learning, or contributing to our open source projects? Let''s connect.SEND MESSAGE',601,'ad12887fa947e0321aea056d85f38a3a472fddc55c9f2bd8a562d5702166abf8','en','captured_public_claim','public',true,'{"chunk_profile":"LP-RAG-CHUNK-1.0","max_characters":3600,"overlap_characters":400,"token_count_method":"ceil_utf16_characters_divided_by_4"}'::jsonb) on conflict (chunk_id) do update set content=excluded.content,token_count=excluded.token_count,content_sha256=excluded.content_sha256,verification_status=excluded.verification_status,access_scope=excluded.access_scope,active=true,metadata=excluded.metadata,updated_at=now();
