Page description: Preserving the wisdom of Asturian elders before it vanishes. XENTE documents traditional knowledge, skills, and stories through intimate video portraits of those who lived different times. StudioXenteXENTEDocumenting wisdom from those who were here before usHERITAGE PROJECTPRESERVING THE WISDOM OF GENERATIONSXente is a heritage nonprofit project dedicated to documenting conversations from our elders. We aim to conserve the knowledge of traditions and times long gone, ensuring that the wisdom of those who were here before us is not lost to time.FEATUREDHIGHLIGHTED CONVERSATIONA special conversation capturing invaluable wisdom and heritage knowledge.ELDER WISDOMAnother precious conversation preserving the voice and knowledge of our elders.HERITAGE STORIESMore voices from our community, sharing their knowledge and experiences.FULL CONVERSATIONS COLLECTIONWatch our complete collection of documented conversations, preserving the voices and wisdom of those who came before us.ALICIA: XENTE ASTURIANAA beautiful conversation with Alicia, sharing the wisdom and traditions of Asturian heritage.LUIS BLANCO: UN PAISANOMeet Luis Blanco, a true paisano sharing his life experiences and deep connection to the land.NIEVES: LA ÚLTIMA MINERAThe story of Nieves, the last woman miner, preserving a unique chapter of our heritage and labor history.HERITAGE VOICESMore voices from our community sharing their wisdom and life stories.COMMUNITY STORIESContinuing our journey through the stories and traditions that define our community.ELDERS'' WISDOMMore precious conversations preserving the knowledge and experiences of our community elders.TRADITIONAL KNOWLEDGEDocumenting the traditional practices and knowledge passed down through generations.DOCUMENTRecording conversations and stories from elders who carry generations of knowledge, wisdom, and lived experience.PRESERVECreating a lasting archive of traditions, techniques, and cultural practices before they fade from living memory.CONNECTBridging generations by creating meaningful dialogue between elders and younger community members.HONORRecognizing and celebrating the invaluable contribution of our elders to cultural heritage and collective memory.WHY IT MATTERSEvery day, we lose irreplaceable knowledge as elders pass away. Their stories, techniques, and understanding of the world represent centuries of accumulated wisdom.Xente exists to ensure this knowledge doesn''t disappear. Through careful documentation and preservation, we create a living archive that future generations can learn from, draw inspiration from, and build upon.Because some things are too valuable to lose.GET INVOLVEDHelp us preserve heritage. Share stories. Connect generations.CONTACT USExplore MoreWorkOur projectsPeopleMeet the teamAboutOur story',749,'a20d80f915a54feb86ee635636bf49778b9fbf1c61a61b2e2c04b7d8cba36c12','en','captured_public_claim','public',true,'{"chunk_profile":"LP-RAG-CHUNK-1.0","max_characters":3600,"overlap_characters":400,"token_count_method":"ceil_utf16_characters_divided_by_4"}'::jsonb) on conflict (chunk_id) do update set content=excluded.content,token_count=excluded.token_count,content_sha256=excluded.content_sha256,verification_status=excluded.verification_status,access_scope=excluded.access_scope,active=true,metadata=excluded.metadata,updated_at=now();
